@startuml

title One entry of the run token cache, keyed by grant id and run id

hide empty description

[*] --> exchanging : first request of the run\non this replica
exchanging --> fresh : IAM answers a token
exchanging --> failed : IAM refuses, or does not answer\ninside the step's budget
fresh --> fresh : a request uses the token
fresh --> stale : less than 20% of the\nlifetime is left
stale --> exchanging : the next request\n(concurrent misses share it)
fresh --> exchanging : an owner answers token_expired\n(one retry of the request)
fresh --> evicted : the step completes, the run ends,\nor the LRU bound is reached
stale --> evicted : the run ends,\nor the LRU bound is reached
failed --> [*] : the step fails with the reason
evicted --> [*]

@enduml
